    <title>ECA highlights urgent need to transform informal work into sustainable livelihoods for Africa&#039;s youth</title>
    <link>https://www.uneca.org/stories/eca-highlights-urgent-need-to-transform-informal-work-into-sustainable-livelihoods-for</link>
